# Ali from Cairo replaces only the life loss damage causes, and only while its controller has 1 or more life (the
# rulings: "This effect does not apply to effects which reduce your life without doing damage"; CR 120.3a, 614.1a).
# Bot1, at 2 life, controls Ali and Platinum Angel, so it stays in the game at 0 or less. Bot2's Tendrils of Agony makes
# Bot1 lose 2 life: no damage, so Bot1 goes to 0, not 1. Bot2's Lightning Bolt then deals 3 to Bot1 at 0 life: the
# damage would not reduce a life total of 1 or more to less than 1, so it is not replaced, and Bot1 goes to -3.

